            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Parker Kirlew"
            },
            "reviewBody": "So, I chose to bake these wings instead of using a grill. I baked the wings for 20 minutes. I only had the garlic power, 1.5 cups of butters, hot sauce, and the pepper vinegar sauce on for the first 20 minutes. After those 20 minutes were up, I took the wings out and added more hot sauce, and the parmesan cheese. I then put the wings into the oven for 25 minutes. Before serving, I added lots of paprika, and about 2 tsp of seasoning salt, and a little more vinegar pepper sauce. Yummy!",
            "datePublished": "2018-03-10T01:53:06.303Z"
          },
          {
