              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Sharon Whitley"
            },
            "reviewBody": "We loved it! I made it in an air fryer, cooking it at 400 for 13 minutes per side. Once it was done and added the sauce, I put it in a toaster oven for about 7 minutes.",
